    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15346" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρ-όσιμος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρόω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>arable,
				fruitful,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>
			<i>corn</i>-land, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				137.14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				5.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀροπέδια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					6.2.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.5.19
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				9.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.Byz.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				1.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>fit for engendering</i> children, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				569
			</span></i> (in form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρώσιμος</span>).</div>
